[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4566920450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119845#issuecomment-4566920450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119845","id":4566920450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEDWtAg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T18:08:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T18:08:39Z","body":"I can't reproduce a lag spike when running the MRP on an M2 MBP. \n\nIf the lag spike is only on one frame the issue is likely from shader compilation stutters. In order to precompile a shader, the shader needs to be present in the scene tree at load time (it doesn't have to be visible, it just needs to be in the scenetree). Creating materials on the fly and then adding them into the scene at run time always has the potential to create shader compilation stutters. For more info see here: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/performance/pipeline_compilations.html","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4566920450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4569813206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119845#issuecomment-4569813206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119845","id":4569813206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEGHQ1g","user":{"login":"Luprasteri","id":89762406,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NzYyNDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89762406?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri","html_url":"https://github.com/Luprasteri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luprasteri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T01:55:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T01:55:03Z","body":"I just tested this in Compatibility mode and lag spike doesn't happen anymore, so i guess the issue comes from shader compilations as you said.\n\nThanks for the info!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4569813206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4608440108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119845#issuecomment-4608440108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119845","id":4608440108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEq83LA","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T01:59:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T01:59:17Z","body":"I tested the MRP (and totally forgot to comment the results here before, ops) and the engine has more than a lag spike, we have a significant FPS drop after 4.6 dev 6 and gets even worse on 4.6 beta 1. Only affects Vulkan and the mobile renderer seems to be less impacted, but also have a perfomance loss. Here the results using official builds:\n\n<br>\n\n4.5 dev 5 - Stable 60 FPS and Physics Process time around 24ms\n\n<details><summary> Image </summary>\n\n<img width=\"1357\" height=\"974\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/896fe3de-b4f0-43ab-9805-f45d365bb986\" />\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n4.6 dev 6 - Average 40 FPS and Physics Process time jump to 140ms\n\n<details><summary> Image </summary>\n\n<img width=\"1353\" height=\"968\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a40cba3d-8b6d-4de4-8664-6937f866397a\" />\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n4.6 beta 1 - Average 30 FPS and Physics Process time go to 215ms\n\n<details><summary> Image </summary>\n\n<img width=\"1354\" height=\"969\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/548567af-528c-4457-b11f-56b4a2f35bb3\" />\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\nLooking the changes on 4.6 dev 6 and beta 1, the only thing in common on both versions was related with the re-spirv, so i tested to confirm. All the versions was compiled on MSVC with `production=yes` `scu_build=yes`:\n\n4.6 dev 5 - Very similar to the official build, stable 60 FPS and Physics Process time around 28ms\n\n<details><summary> Image </summary>\n\n<img width=\"1357\" height=\"973\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/147a95e7-05e4-42f6-a23c-dd66befe4b32\" />\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n4.6 beta 1 - FPS around 35 and Physics Process time at 145ms\n\n<details><summary> Image </summary>\n\n<img width=\"1363\" height=\"981\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/defe7854-0a99-42ca-b6b8-e2eb5bc4b2ea\" />\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\n4.6 beta 1 with `RESPV_ENABLED 0` - Back to values similar from 4.6 dev 5\n\n<details><summary> Image </summary>\n\n<img width=\"1350\" height=\"974\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/931f06f8-226c-438c-8773-55ead624ba4a\" />\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\nSo it seems a regression from #111452 on 4.6 dev 6 and probably made worse on 4.6 beta 1 by #113582. CC @DarioSamo ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4608440108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4609373591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119845#issuecomment-4609373591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119845","id":4609373591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEr11lw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T05:29:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T05:29:28Z","body":"> I tested the MRP (and totally forgot to comment the results here before, ops) and the engine has more than a lag spike, we have a significant FPS drop after 4.6 dev 6 and gets even worse on 4.6 beta 1. Only affects Vulkan and the mobile renderer seems to be less impacted, but also have a perfomance loss.\n\nKeep in mind, the MRP is force creating and freeing the shader every frame. So the shader is recompiled every frame. Measuring FPS is misleading since you are measuring the performance of something that would typically only happen once (at load time). In other words, FPS is artificially impacted in this MRP","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4609373591/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]